+  // Reconstruct the branch from (rangeIdx, deadline), then splice the veneer
+  // into the label-use chain right after it:
+  //
+  //   label -> ... -> bc -> next -> ...   becomes
+  //   label -> ... -> bc -> veneer(b) -> next -> ...
+  //
+  // The bc's link now points at the veneer, which is also its branch target
+  // until bind(): bindShortBranch() either retargets the bc directly (target
+  // in reach) or leaves it pointing at the veneer, which is bound like any
+  // other short `b` in the chain.
+  MOZ_RELEASE_ASSERT(rangeIdx == BcRangeIdx);
